.TH LUXAFOR-STATUS 1 "" "luxafor-status" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
luxafor-status \- control a Luxafor status light from the desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B luxafor-status
.br
.B luxafor-status
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B luxafor-status
is one program with several commands, also installed under their own
names:
.TP
.BR toggle ", " luxafor-toggle (1)
set or cycle the status, timers, settings;
.TP
.BR light ", " luxafor-light (1)
drive the light directly;
.TP
.BR tray ", " luxafor-tray (1)
the tray icon, started at login;
.TP
.BR panel ", " luxafor-panel (1)
the panel \(em also what
.B luxafor-status
alone opens;
.TP
.BR callwatch ", " luxafor-callwatch (1)
call detection on its own.
.PP
Any other argument is passed to
.BR toggle :
.B luxafor-status busy \-\-for 30
is
.BR "luxafor-toggle busy \-\-for 30" .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR luxafor-toggle (1),
.BR luxafor-panel (1),
.BR luxafor-tray (1)
